Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 23:06:45 -0400
Subject: fetch: csv source tier for Google-Sheets-style reports

A url/trails descriptor can declare "csv": true; the body is parsed into
rows (array of string-arrays) and handed to the resort's parse function,
same as json:true hands it parsed JSON. Small resorts commonly publish
their lift/trail report as a published-to-web Google Sheet.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
